{"id":259,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Marshtomp is much faster at traveling through mud than it is at swimming. This Pokémon’s hindquarters exhibit obvious development, giving it the ability to walk on just its hind legs."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"The surface of Marshtomp’s body is enveloped by a thin, sticky film that enables it to live on land. This Pokémon plays in mud on beaches when the ocean tide is low."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It is at its best when on muddy ground with poor footing. It quickly overwhelms foes struggling in mud."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its toughened hind legs enable it to stand upright. Because it weakens if its skin dries out, it replenishes fluids by playing in mud."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Damp","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon dampens its surroundings, preventing all Pokémon from using explosive moves such as Self-Destruct."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":258,"name":"Mudkip","condition":null,"children":[{"id":259,"name":"Marshtomp","condition":"Lv. 16","children":[{"id":260,"name":"Swampert","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,341],[1,33],[1,45],[1,55],[9,88],[12,182],[15,48],[20,352],[25,157],[30,36],[35,133],[40,330],[45,103],[50,283],[55,56]],"machine":[133,419,59,34,280,523,886,174,91,38,414,89,283,203,263,374,264,270,56,58,8,196,710,67,341,189,330,182,2